OL,3,AState pension likely to rise by 3.9%
OL,4,Anext April
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state pension is likely to rise by
OL,7,F#9.40 a week to #250.70 next April,
OL,8,Faccording to the latest jobs and pay
OL,9,Fdata.
OL,11,FUnder the triple lock pension
OL,12,Fguarantee, the increase is based on
OL,13,Feither average wage growth, inflation
OL,14,For 2.5% - whichever is highest.
OL,16,FAverage wage growth, including bonuses,
OL,17,Fbetween May and July slowed to 3.9%,
OL,18,Faccording to the Office for National
OL,19,FStatistics.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
